  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup quick-cooking oats",
    "2 tablespoons melted butter",
    "2 teaspoons brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "3 medium peaches, halved and pitted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the air fryer to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WTmb5JhDjCP8d6voic25g03yF9U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8468500-Air-Fryer-Grilled-Peaches-DDMFS-Step-01-5b77468a47014722acb247701513b4b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8468500/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine oats, butter, brown sugar, cinnamon, and vanilla in a small bowl. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jzdqjWU47mrbseRU0lWprHoTIoU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8468500-Air-Fryer-Grilled-Peaches-DDMFS-Step-02-134d3f6f16974592ac213f785d8bfe02.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8468500/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon out some of the flesh of the peaches. Place peaches skin side up into the air fryer basket. Air fry for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/krW8W5I-x-VJgA4L7EEp2cy2DIs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8468500-Air-Fryer-Grilled-Peaches-DDMFS-Step-03-2ec1c3e001484e37b74d6bf46ccfb54e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8468500/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn peaches over and spoon 1/2 tablespoon of the oat mixture into each cavity. Air fry until oats are golden brown and crispy, 2 to 3 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
